[0.017821, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J\r\n\r\n   \u001b[1m\u001b[36mopticli\u001b[0m  —  read and change Optimizely CMS 12 content from the terminal\r\n\r\n   \u001b[2mfor developers and their coding agents · reads straight from SQL · writes through the CMS API\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n   \u001b[2mDemo: the Alloy sample site (CMS 12, .NET 8) with a local SQL Server database\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
